    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements:</p><p>Statement I:&nbsp;Permutit process is more efficient compared to the synthetic resin method for the softening of water.</p><p>Statement II:&nbsp;Synthetic resin method results in the formation of soluble sodium salts.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>",
